===APP===
name: weather
title: Weather
about: Weather for your city
net: none
===FEATURES===
- shows the city and its temperature in metric units
- c changes the city
===DATA===
city -> text, starts with the city Colombo (from the user's memory); the user can change it with c
===SCREEN===
Row 1 title, row 3 "Weather for CITY", last row key help.
===KEYS===
c changes the city; q and Esc quit.
